Z||000012||Butter||12-14-2001||01:04 PM||||Well Cliff I happen to perceive a lot you say differently.  Look at it from a different point.  The world has the largest population ever so life is winning at this point.  We (USA) are fighting over a more positive way to think that will promote life and give us all the liberty of free thought progressing from fighting over territory or monetary things.  Yea there are more conflicts going on in the world other than America's battle and I pray that the folks with the best intentions of promoting more abundant life  come out the victors.  What will it take for humanity to progress past conflict into an age of peace?  I don't know but I believe I have a good idea and it ain't pretty judging from history.  While we are still in an age of conflict I plan on standing up for the proclamation of life, up to the point of giving mine for it.  With Life we have the oppurtunity to learn and do better.||||reg||1
