Z||000018||fierohoho||12-14-2001||04:36 PM||||Hmmmmmm...My random observations.<P>Millions of years of evolution revolving around the fact that to survive we had to kill for food, shelter/territory and to breed.<P>Survival of the fitest.<P>In the real world the meek will not inherit the earth.<P>We survived by our ability to use tools and create weapons better than the other guy.<P>It's hard to go against that much instinctual evolution when you are fighting for survival, it's kill or be killed and lets do it as efficiently as we can to limit our losses.<P>Have we caused species to go extinct? Yes, but, in the last 100 million years the number of species that have gone extinct far far outway the drop in the bucket we have killed, will I miss the Dodo, don't know, haven't tasted one.<P>Have we harmed the planet, yes, but not nearly as much as the meteor that killed the dinosaurs, in time when we wise up we'll let the planet repair itself, we'll be fine.<P>Gotta finish up and leave the room, the old cocker spaniel dropped one and it reeks in here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lightbar.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000019||Voytek||12-14-2001||05:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierohoho:<BR><B>Hmmmmmm...My random observations.<P><BR>We survived by our ability to use tools and create weapons better than the other guy.<P>It's hard to go against that much instinctual evolution when you are fighting for survival, it's kill or be killed and lets do it as efficiently as we can to limit our losses.<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>ACTUALLY, if everyone helped each other, all would be strong and equal.<P>'Kill or be killed' - killed by whom?  That's exactly what this is about - if everynoe too it to heart, you wouldn't have to worry about 'survival of the fittest' and being killed.  If you were weak, all would help you.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
